---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { company } from '../data/site';
const c = company.contact;
---
<Legal title="Privacy Policy" path="/privacy-policy" updated="27 November 2026"
  description="How SMART (Pvt) Ltd collects, uses and protects personal information on findoursmart.com and in the services we provide.">
  <p>This policy explains what personal information {company.legalName} ("SMART", "we") collects when you use findoursmart.com or contact us, why we collect it, and the choices you have. We follow the Personal Data Protection Act, No. 9 of 2022, of Sri Lanka.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you send us:</strong> your name, business name, phone number, email address and anything you write in a message, when you contact us by WhatsApp, phone, email or the message form.</li>
    <li><strong>Project information:</strong> content you share for a project, such as text, photos, logos and menus.</li>
    <li><strong>Basic technical data:</strong> our hosting provider may record standard server logs (IP address, browser type, pages visited) to keep the site secure and working.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This website does not use advertising cookies and does not sell personal information.</p>

  <h2>How the message form works</h2>
  <p>The form on this site does not store your message on our servers. When you press "Send on WhatsApp", your browser opens WhatsApp with your message ready, and you choose whether to send it. Messages you send through WhatsApp are handled under WhatsApp's own privacy policy.</p>

  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to you and prepare quotes.</li>
    <li>To build, deliver and support the work you ask for.</li>
    <li>To send invoices and keep records the law requires.</li>
    <li>To improve our website and services.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>We share information only with service providers we need to do the work, such as hosting, domain registrars and messaging platforms, and only as much as they need. We may also share information when the law requires it. We never sell it.</p>

  <h2>Embedded content</h2>
  <p>Some pages show content from other services, such as Google Maps. Those services may collect data according to their own policies when the content loads.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>We keep enquiry messages for as long as needed to answer them and for any follow-up project. We keep project and billing records for as long as tax and company law requires.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to show you, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you, or to stop using it. Contact us using the details below and we will respond within a reasonable time.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your information. No method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, but we work to keep your data safe.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>{company.legalName}<br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${c.email}`}>{c.email}</a><br />
    Phone and WhatsApp: <a href={`tel:${c.phone}`}>{c.phoneDisplay}</a>
    {c.address && <><br />{[c.address, c.city, c.postalCode, c.country].filter(Boolean).join(', ')}</>}
  </p>
</Legal>
